# .trivyignore — documented, time-boxed exceptions for Trivy scans (FR-005, research D3).
# The PR security check hard-fails on HIGH/CRITICAL vulns and committed secrets;
# add an exception here ONLY with a comment stating the CVE, why it can't be fixed yet,
# the owner, and a review-by date. Every entry weakens the gate — keep this list short.
#
# Example:
#   CVE-2024-XXXXX  # transitive via <pkg>, no fix upstream yet; review by 2026-09-01 (owner: @you)
